          {
            // Five real moments, placed at the map coordinates where they
            // happened. The opening chain all plays out within a few
            // hundred atlas pixels of Pallet Town, which is a handful of
            // screen pixels once all 226 maps are in frame — too close to
            // draw each clip at its own location without piling them on
            // top of each other. So each inset is hand-placed around the
            // frame's edge instead, and the callout layer below it draws
            // the line back to where the moment actually happened. The
            // line is the claim, not the inset's position. Every timestamp
            // here was checked by reading the milestone caption the run
            // itself burned into that frame — see the evidence table in
            // examples/README.md.
